Research: RP earned per expedition: 22, 3, 2, 5, 4, 3 (mean 6.5). The bot deconstructs raw finds, infuses essences into the sword, studies up to three families per expedition and learns the cheapest technique it can afford.
Affordable = the first expedition whose cumulative RP earned covers the technique with what it needs first (the group technique, for a slot), at the real techCost (a slot technique costs 3 once its group is known, and the first one after a group technique is free). Learned = the expedition the bot bought it:
